## 🚀 Quick Start (30 Minutes)

### Step 1: Set Up Project Structure (5 min)
```bash
# Create directory structure
mkdir -p app/src/main/res/drawable/ui_controls
mkdir -p app/src/main/res/drawable/characters
mkdir -p app/src/main/res/font
mkdir -p app/src/main/res/raw
```

### Step 2: Add Color Resources (5 min)
Copy `colors.xml` from asset-directory-guide to `res/values/`

### Step 3: Create Color Object (5 min)
Copy `Colors.kt` from asset-kit-implementation to `ui/theme/`

### Step 4: Create Typography System (5 min)
Copy `Typography.kt` from asset-kit-implementation to `ui/theme/`

### Step 5: Build First Component (5 min)
Copy `StreetTycoonButtons.kt` from asset-kit-implementation to `ui/components/`

### Step 6: Test in Compose Preview (5 min)
Create a preview composable and test button renders

**Result**: Working button component with proper theming!

